---
title: "member_profile_edit (Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: check authenticated session
    q_auth --> q_error_unauth: session invalid
    q_auth --> q_resolve: session valid
    q_resolve --> q_authz: determine target profile ID and requesting user
    q_authz --> q_check_owner: is requester the profile owner?
    q_check_owner --> q_allow: requester == profile owner
    q_check_owner --> q_check_admin: requester != profile owner
    q_check_admin --> q_allow: requester is admin
    q_check_admin --> q_error_forbidden: requester is not admin
    q_allow --> q_validate_input: validate edit fields (status, generation, student_number)
    q_validate_input --> q_error_validation: input invalid
    q_validate_input --> q_update: input valid
    q_update --> [*]: update member record, return success
    q_error_unauth --> [*]: return unauthorized error
    q_error_forbidden --> [*]: return forbidden error
    q_error_validation --> [*]: return validation error

    note right of q_authz
        INV-001: General users can only edit their own profile
        INV-002: Admin users can edit any profile
        INV-003: Authorization must be checked before any mutation
    end note

    note right of q_validate_input
        INV-004: All input fields must be validated before DB update
    end note
